   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask for an appointment",
   "texto": [
    "**Fastlege** is the head doctor; **legekontor**, the consultation or center where he works. **bestille time hos fastlegen** («order an appointment with the head doctor») is said. **timebestilling** («date reserve») is also used in Norwegian health information."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Recipes",
   "texto": [
    "A **resept** is a prescription. **Fornye resepten** means to request a renewal of a recipe that already exists. **Undersøke** is to examine; **pasient**, patient.",
    "In Spanish we usually say «ask for an appointment with the doctor»; in Norwegian **hos** accompanies the professional: **hos fastlegen**."
   ]
